  "about": "LumaKit menu (lumakit.md 2.12, lumakit-modules.md row 18): kit-menu-b (first in the Mods list) adds Kit B, kit-menu adds Kit A one, two and off (disabled). In the pause menu they stand as the game's buttons under Back and Quit, two by two: Kit B and A one, then A two and A off, in one highlight with Back, Quit and Settings. UP DOWN LEFT reach Kit B, lit as the game's button (picture lit), and A takes it (two_mods_order, chosen); RIGHT goes across to A one, A takes it; DOWN passes A off (never highlighted) to Settings, LEFT from there is A two, A takes it (disabled: a_off never runs); kit-menu removes A two (removed), kit-menu-b is taken out and its entry leaves, UP DOWN LEFT reach Kit A first and A takes it (mod_stops). close_pause: Kit A one's second run closes the game's pause menu as its pause button does; 90 frames on the game plays again. Pictures: entries (Back and Quit made smaller and moved up, the four rows two by two under them, labels whole) with a box around the rows against its reference; lit is taken to look at.",
